# GNU Radio GENERATED flowgraph artifacts. The .grc is the SOURCE; the .py is
# its build output, and nothing in the repo consumes the checked-in copy —
# verification/grc_userpath_run.py regenerates into a tempdir from the .grc.
#
# Tracking generated output beside hand-written source is what let GRC's
# "Generate" silently destroy examples/gru_classifier/gru_classifier.py (the
# loss reads as an ordinary edit in git status) and what let the CSS display
# block sit at 4 outputs while its flowgraph wired 6. Regenerate, don't track.
#
# Listed explicitly rather than by wildcard: examples/*.py also holds
# HAND-WRITTEN design modules (gru_classifier.py, css_decode_map.py,
# fft128_2p2s_spectrum.py, the *_demo.py runners, gen_grc.py) which must stay
# tracked. INV-43's gate in test_examples_grc_valid.py keeps the two kinds
# from colliding on a filename.
.mypy_cache/
examples/bpsk_transceiver_loopback/bpsk_loopback.py
examples/am_transceiver/am_transceiver.py
examples/audio_effects/effect_comb.py
examples/audio_effects/effect_echo.py
examples/audio_effects/effect_tremolo.py
examples/audio_meter/audio_meter.py
